Osmoregulation woh amal hai jis se organism apne andar pani aur ghule hue maddon ka tawazun (balance) qaim rakhta hai, bahar ka mahaul jaisa bhi ho.
Hydrophytes (pani ke plants) samandar aur meethe pani mein rehte hain:
A. Samandari (marine) hydrophytes namkeen (hypertonic) pani mein hain jahan pani cells se nikalna chahta hai. Yeh:
- zaid namak khaas salt glands se bahar nikalte hain;
- organic solutes (proline, glycine betaine, sugars) banate hain jo andar ki concentration barha kar pani rok lete hain;
- moti cuticle (mom ki teh) se pani ka nuqsan kam karte hain aur halophytes jaisi salahiyat se namak bardasht karte hain.
B. Meethe pani (freshwater) ke hydrophytes hypotonic pani mein hain jahan pani musalsal cells mein aata hai. Yeh:
- zaid pani hydathodes ya vacuoles se nikalte hain taake zyada pani se nuqsan na ho;
- potassium aur calcium jaise ions active tor par jazb karte hain taake halke pani mein balance rahe;
- in ki cuticle patli ya ghaib aur jarein kam hoti hain; pani aur ghiza seedha pani se lete hain.
Misalein: water lily, lotus, seaweeds, tape grass.
Halophytes namkeen zameen ya pani (NaCl, MgCl₂, MgSO₄ zyada) mein ugte hain. Wahan sirf zyada namak bardasht karne wale plants ug sakte hain. In ki adjustments:
- apna cell sap namkeen mitti se zyada gaarha rakhte hain (namak le kar aur proline/glycine betaine bana kar) taake pani phir bhi jaron mein aaye (beyond the chapter: chapter yeh marine hydrophytes ke liye batata hai);
- gooddar (succulent) patte aur kabhi tana pani zakheera kar ke namak ko halka karte hain;
- kuch ke patte kanton (spines) mein badle hote hain jo pani bachate hain;
- salt glands zaid namak nikalte hain.
Misalein: sea arrowgrass, sea lavender; samandar ke kinare daldal wale halophytes mangrove (tidal woodland) banate hain.
